            "fontSize": 27.142857142857146,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "One way that a filter may work is by initializing a blank array \ninto which we will save our results. Then using a conditional \nstatement. If true, we push that song into the blank array.",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "One way that a filter may work is by initializing a blank array \ninto which we will save our results. Then using a conditional \nstatement. If true, we push that song into the blank array.",
            "lineHeight": 1.3,
            "baseline": 95
